# AB-024: Compare antacid capacity per gram without confusing fizz with neutralisation
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 HCl 0.004mol
add v1 Mg(OH)2 0.1g
measure v1 ph
inspect v1
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 HCl 0.004mol
add v2 CaCO3 0.1g
measure v2 ph
inspect v2
